@page "/chat"
@** The Chat's examples (design-extended-library.md §2.3, cluster 4): a state, the roles'
    bubbles, the streaming answer — the provider is the app's. *@
@import { Typography } from "@tsazor/bootstrap"
@import Example from "../Example.tsazor"
@import ChatStateExample from "../examples/chat/chat-state.tsazor"

<Typography Variant="h1">Chat</Typography>
<Typography>
    The chat's pieces: a `ChatState` (the list, the streaming draft — no provider, no key, the
    app feeds its own source), the `Chat` (bubbles by role, the assistant's Markdown, the list
    pinned to its bottom while the answer streams), and the `PromptInput` (Enter sends and clears).
</Typography>

